<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Détails Projets | Ethan Lavignon</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syncopate:wght@700&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        /* --- TON CSS PRINCIPAL --- */
        :root { --dark: #080808; --gray: #151515; --blue: #002e63; --orange: #ff4500; --text: #e0e0e0; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            margin: 0; 
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; 
            background: var(--dark); 
            color: var(--text); 
            scroll-behavior: smooth; 
            overflow-x: hidden; 
        }
        
        /* Barre de progression */
        #progress-bar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; height: 5px; background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--blue), var(--orange)); width: 0%; z-index: 3000; }
        
        /* Navigation */
        nav { 
            display: flex; 
            justify-content: space-between; 
            align-items: center; 
            padding: 15px 5%; 
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.95); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
            position: fixed; 
            width: 100%; 
            z-index: 2000; 
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222; 
        }
        .logo { font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--orange); }
        .nav-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: flex-end; }
        .nav-links a { 
            color: white; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-size: 0.55rem; 
            letter-spacing: 1px; 
            text-transform: uppercase; 
            font-weight: 700; 
            padding: 4px; 
            transition: 0.3s; 
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--orange); }

        /* Sections */
        section { 
            min-height: 100vh; 
            padding: 120px 10% 60px 10%; 
            display: flex; 
            flex-direction: column; 
            justify-content: flex-start; 
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222; 
        }
        .bg-gray { background: var(--gray); }
        
        h1 { font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2.5rem); margin: 0 0 30px 0; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); }
        h2 { color: var(--orange); font-family: 'Syncopate'; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        
        .btn-lire { 
            background: var(--blue); 
            color: white; 
            padding: 12px 25px; 
            border-radius: 20px; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-weight: 700; 
            border: 1px solid #444; 
            display: inline-flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            margin-top: 20px; 
            transition: 0.3s; 
            font-size: 0.8rem; 
            cursor: pointer; 
        }
        .btn-lire:hover { background: var(--orange); transform: scale(1.05); }

        .card { background: #111; padding: 30px; border-top: 4px solid var(--blue); border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 20px; }
        
        footer { padding: 40px; background: #000; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #222; font-size: 0.7rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="progress-bar"></div>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">ETHAN LAVIGNON | BUT GEII</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="index.html">← Retour Accueil</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section>
        <h1>Détails Techniques</h1>
        <div class="card">
            <h2>Approfondissement : Robotique</h2>
            <p>Sur cette page, je peux détailler les schémas de câblage, les algorithmes de commande et les choix des composants (capteurs, drivers moteurs) utilisés lors de mes projets en BUT GEII.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="border-top-color: var(--orange);">
            <h2>Schémas & Documentation</h2>
            <p>L'organisation rigoureuse de la documentation technique est essentielle pour la maintenance industrielle et la traçabilité des projets.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="index.html" class="btn-lire">Retour au Portfolio</a>
    </section>

    <footer><p>Ethan Lavignon • Page Secondaire • 2026</p></footer>

    <script>
        window.onscroll = function() { 
            var winScroll = document.body.scrollTop || document.documentElement.scrollTop; 
            var height = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - document.documentElement.clientHeight; 
            var scrolled = (winScroll / height) * 100; 
            document.getElementById("progress-bar").style.width = scrolled + "%"; 
        };
    </script>
</body>
</html>
